WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:05,380
Kill me. What's wrong, brother?

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:12,770
There is a monster

3
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:15,290
I thought it was a human being at first and it scared me.

4
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:21,650
Can you see what the one who came out of the hole looks like a human being?

5
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:22,810
green eyes

6
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:26,850
He was just crawling on all fours and gave me the overnight meal in the middle of the night.

7
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:27,770
Almost scared out of my mind

8
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:33,340
I'm still thinking

9
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,380
Did you meet someone?

10
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,900
He even shouted loudly and now he is outside the door.

11
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,980
The cold is killing us

12
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,980
My dear boy works hard

13
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:46,610
Well, now I'll give you a meat shop. Change it. Change it. I'll put it in.
